  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 1.46,
      "e": 3.46,
      "text": "65 years ago,"
    },
    {
      "s": 3.46,
      "e": 7.09,
      "text": "the president signed a historic piece of legislation."
    },
    {
      "s": 7.17,
      "e": 12.6,
      "text": "It stated that the United States space activities should be peaceful"
    },
    {
      "s": 12.68,
      "e": 18.1,
      "text": "and that they should be done for the benefit of humanity."
    },
    {
      "s": 18.18,
      "e": 22.15,
      "text": "It created what we know today as NASA."
    },
    {
      "s": 22.23,
      "e": 25.94,
      "text": "And so this year, we celebrate the anniversary"
    },
    {
      "s": 25.94,
      "e": 29.4,
      "text": "of a storied agency and agency"
    },
    {
      "s": 29.4,
      "e": 33.62,
      "text": "recognized by its iconic logo,"
    },
    {
      "s": 33.66,
      "e": 38.04,
      "text": "an agency that is revered around the world."
    },
    {
      "s": 38.12,
      "e": 43.42,
      "text": "America is defined by possibilities."
    },
    {
      "s": 43.5,
      "e": 48.55,
      "text": "We have always been a nation that is restless and less pressing"
    },
    {
      "s": 48.55,
      "e": 50.72,
      "text": "into the unknown."
    },
    {
      "s": 50.72,
      "e": 53.51,
      "text": "For the past 65 years, NASA"
    },
    {
      "s": 53.51,
      "e": 57.31,
      "text": "responded to America's clarion call."
    },
    {
      "s": 57.39,
      "e": 61.48,
      "text": "The story of NASA is the story of technologies"
    },
    {
      "s": 61.48,
      "e": 65.44,
      "text": "transformed a barriers broken"
    },
    {
      "s": 65.52,
      "e": 70.4,
      "text": "of making the impossible possible."
    },
    {
      "s": 70.49,
      "e": 74.57,
      "text": "Just think of the Apollo,"
    },
    {
      "s": 74.66,
      "e": 77.28,
      "text": "Space Shuttle"
    },
    {
      "s": 77.28,
      "e": 79.2,
      "text": "Viking,"
    },
    {
      "s": 79.2,
      "e": 81.41,
      "text": "Voyager,"
    },
    {
      "s": 81.41,
      "e": 83.92,
      "text": "Cassini,"
    },
    {
      "s": 83.92,
      "e": 85.92,
      "text": "Landsat,"
    },
    {
      "s": 86.0,
      "e": 91.17,
      "text": "Galileo, Hubble,"
    },
    {
      "s": 91.26,
      "e": 93.51,
      "text": "Webb."
    },
    {
      "s": 93.51,
      "e": 96.72,
      "text": "Commercial Crew."
    },
    {
      "s": 96.81,
      "e": 100.14,
      "text": "Space Station."
    },
    {
      "s": 100.22,
      "e": 103.81,
      "text": "Perseverance."
    },
    {
      "s": 103.9,
      "e": 106.9,
      "text": "Artemis."
    },
    {
      "s": 106.94,
      "e": 110.86,
      "text": "Nothing has symbolized the character of the American people"
    },
    {
      "s": 110.86,
      "e": 116.99,
      "text": "as explorers, as discoverers, as adventurers."
    },
    {
      "s": 117.08,
      "e": 120.08,
      "text": "Like NASA."
    },
    {
      "s": 120.29,
      "e": 125.54,
      "text": "Together, we are writing NASA's next chapter."
    },
    {
      "s": 125.62,
      "e": 130.3,
      "text": "We are going back to the moon and then on to Mars."
    },
    {
      "s": 130.38,
      "e": 134.93,
      "text": "We are even changing the way we fly in the air."
    },
    {
      "s": 135.01,
      "e": 137.22,
      "text": "We are developing game changing"
    },
    {
      "s": 137.22,
      "e": 141.85,
      "text": "technologies and conducting life saving research."
    },
    {
      "s": 141.93,
      "e": 145.52,
      "text": "We're using our unique vantage point of space"
    },
    {
      "s": 145.6,
      "e": 148.61,
      "text": "to protect our home planet."
    },
    {
      "s": 148.69,
      "e": 151.19,
      "text": "Every member of the NASA family,"
    },
    {
      "s": 151.19,
      "e": 154.99,
      "text": "including our commercial and international partners,"
    },
    {
      "s": 155.07,
      "e": 160.08,
      "text": "every member today, is essential to NASA's success tomorrow,"
    },
    {
      "s": 160.16,
      "e": 162.5,
      "text": "an entire generation,"
    },
    {
      "s": 162.5,
      "e": 166.79,
      "text": "a new generation, is standing on the threshold,"
    },
    {
      "s": 166.88,
      "e": 172.0,
      "text": "eager to move ahead and ready to stand on our shoulders."
    },
    {
      "s": 172.09,
      "e": 176.68,
      "text": "That generation is the Artemis Generation."
    },
    {
      "s": 176.76,
      "e": 180.26,
      "text": "It's a new era of pioneers and star"
    },
    {
      "s": 180.26,
      "e": 185.1,
      "text": "sailors, thinkers and adventurers."
    },
    {
      "s": 185.19,
      "e": 188.98,
      "text": "And when those star sailors"
    },
    {
      "s": 189.06,
      "e": 192.61,
      "text": "sail on that cosmic sea"
    },
    {
      "s": 192.69,
      "e": 197.11,
      "text": "to those far off cosmic shores,"
    },
    {
      "s": 197.2,
      "e": 202.49,
      "text": "our missions will continue to prove once again"
    },
    {
      "s": 202.58,
      "e": 206.21,
      "text": "that NASA does big things."
    },
    {
      "s": 206.25,
      "e": 209.5,
      "text": "It's the things that inspire us."
    },
    {
      "s": 209.58,
      "e": 215.97,
      "text": "It's the things that unite us."
    },
    {
      "s": 216.05,
      "e": 219.64,
      "text": "We chase the impossible dream,"
    },
    {
      "s": 219.72,
      "e": 224.47,
      "text": "and we reach for the unreachable stars."
    }
